Image: [Wikimedia Commons](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hen_with_anger_eye.jpg)

Wren is a specialized yet pleasant programming language.
Unfortunately, it lacks many of the functions and libraries that
other ecosystems have by default.

Dome Engine is a wonderful game engine with a minimalist approach.

This project was inspired by game libraries like Flash Punk and
Haxe Punk. Its main goal is to bring quality-of-life libraries and
tools that could benefit both Dome Game projects and Vanilla Wren.

## Requirements

- [Dome Engine](https://domenegine.com)
- [Wren](https://wren.io)
- Python 3

## Libraries

- <https://github.com/NinjasCL/domepunk/wiki>

- State Machines
- Palettes
- Tilesets
- Resolutions
- Emoji
- Calculation
- Probabilities
- Percentages
- Statistics
- WrenDoc
- Unit Tests

```github
NinjasCL/domepunk | Bibliotecas para juegos con Wren
```
